                    [<b>97</b>] I would allow the appeal, grant the motion and strike out subparagraphs 1(h), 1(i)(i) and 2(y) of the Amended Notice of Application, with costs to the appellant fixed at $35,000, all inclusive. &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;(5) Membership in a pension plan that is wound up in whole or in part includes the period of notice of termination of employment required under Part XV of the <b>Employment Standards Act</b>, 2000. R.S.O. 1990, c. P.8, s. 74 (5); 2004, c. 31, Sched. 31, s. 3. 
